      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6593c4a4910c4a117fba8646|full_name} the behavior you're requesting is a mostly a product of more effective use of weight painting, and where that doesnt cut it, corrective animations/blendshapes.\n\ncontact senders and recievers can control corrective animations, that will allow you to adjust an intermediate bone (or alter a blendshape) based on the distance of the sender from the reciever.",
